做菜！\r\n　　充实的检索机能\r\n　　游戏的特征之一是方便的检索机能。检索项目可以从日式和西洋等类型中选择，还可以从季节中挑选。还可以听到小幸的推荐菜单。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"こうちゃんの幸せ！ 簡単！ お料理レシ"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"subject","namespace":"bangumi.subject","value":"62936"},"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:59781","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:59781","locator":null,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","type":"subject"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:59781","original":"《小幸的幸福！简单！料理菜谱》是日本游戏制作商fonfun公司制作的一款料理软件游戏，游戏中收录介绍的300种菜谱。而且还加入了声音的向导机能。一边听讲解一边做菜！\r\n　　充实的检索机能\r\n　　游戏的特征之一是方便的检索机能。检索项目可以从日式和西洋等类型中选择，还可以从季节中挑选。还可以听到小幸的推荐菜单。","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","title":"こうちゃんの幸せ！ 簡単！ お料理レシ"}],"score":-29.08464713207624,"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:889674","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:889674","original":"深空文献中心的检索AIAI。全称“智能检索与索引系统”（Intelligent Retrieval & Indexing System）目前所见的这一形态，不过是\"智能检索与索引系统\"的投影而已。作为校园七大不可思议之一，她也是“电子幽灵”。\r\n\r\n对话内容随昼夜更迭而变化。深夜时分，她会在文献中心地下休息室弹奏吉他。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"I.R.I.S."}],"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"201222"},"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:889674","identity_evidence":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:889674","locator":null,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","type":"character"}],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"locator":null,"matched_by":"fts","matched_documents":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:889674","original":"深空文献中心的检索AIAI。全称“智能检索与索引系统”（Intelligent Retrieval & Indexing System）目前所见的这一形态，不过是\"智能检索与索引系统\"的投影而已。作为校园七大不可思议之一，她也是“电子幽灵”。\r\n\r\n对话内容随昼夜更迭而变化。深夜时分，她会在文献中心地下休息室弹奏吉他。","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","title":"I.R.I.S."}],"score":-26.879152419264603,"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"},{"aliases":[],"citations":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:494133","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a"}],"descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:494133","original":"本作为《恋爱绮谭》前两部的fan disk，同时也是系列的“解谜篇”，建议通关《不存在的夏天》与《不存在的真相》后再进行游玩。\r\n\r\n每个谜题，都有答案；每个夏天，都有归宿。\r\n江城的谜团，终究到了解开的一天。\r\n\r\n冬夜的爱心树下，飘雪裹住相拥的恋人。暮春的暖阳里，交换誓言的新人也在交换生命。\r\n这是未被记载的，少年和少女交错的命运。苏半夏、顾真真、陈墨，她们的未来被你续写。\r\n当然，故事并未结束，毕竟——王子和公主还没有幸福地生活在一起。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","status":"source_backed","title":"恋爱绮谭~不存在的回忆~"}],"entry_key":{"kind":"subject","namespace":"bangumi.subject","value":"508732"},"evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff834